SUMMARY:LINES TO LOVE: Screen-Free Afternoon with Your Child
DESCRIPTION:Lines to Love:  A Creative Space for You & Your Child.\nLed by Leo A. Sante\nRemember what it felt like to simply be together with the child you love?\n\nNo screens\, no rush\, no expectations.\n\nJust being side by side\, doodling\, making up stories\, letting your imaginations wander wherever they wanted to go. \nLines to Love brings you back to that space. \nUsing a simple roll of paper and a few drawing materials\, you and your child will be guided into a playful world of co-creation. \nTogether\, you’ll follow lines\, add to each other’s doodles\, build whimsical stories\, and let the drawing become a pathway to imagination. \nLines to Love is inspired by a cherished ritual between a father\, Leo\, and his young son\, Lucas.  Back when Lucas was little\, Leo would just roll out paper and two pens. Together they’d spend hours just doodling\, creating\, and enjoying the precious time together. Both Leo and Lucas cherish those drawings and those moments to this day. \nThis is a free flowing togetherness workshop. It’s a rare chance to share precious\, screen-free time. To explore\, wonder\, laugh\, doodle quietly. To create something beautiful side by side. \nNo artistic skills necessary. Just bring your open hearts.\nAll materials will be provided. \nYou’ll leave with unforgettable memories and a creation you’ll both cherish all your lives. \n\nTicket is for an adult + 1 child. The event is structured for 1:1 time.\nAdditional members of a family are welcome\nEach child should be joined by an adult.\nAll materials will be provided.\nAll phones will be off and set aside for the duration of the session.\nSpace is limited to 15 pairs\, so we recommend you reserve early.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/lines-to-love_2026/
LOCATION:The Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, loft #2\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,The Space for Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/58173edd-cfd5-4632-b996-40a90007af2c.jpeg
END:VEVENT
