SUMMARY:The Space for Music:  Mr. Rose 'Dream House'\, with Era 'Of Love'
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, October 3\, at the Space\, sliding scale donation $20 – $30\n\nDoors open at 7:30pm\nEra ‘Of Love’ opening act beings at 8pm\nMr. Rose starts at 8:30pm\n\n\n\nMr. Rose is back!  These local favorites are at the Space to play their latest album in its entirety\, ‘Dream House’.  This will be a super special performance leading up to the release of the album at the end of this year\, so come for the first listen!\n\nThe core members of Mr. Rose are:\n\n\nJohn Sherman on vocals and accordion\nFred Parcells on trombone\nBilly Loos on drums\nDave Lockhart on upright bass\n\nWe will be joined by John Ehlis on mandolin\, who plays on many of the songs we recorded for ‘Dream House’.  Other special guest musicians will also be joining them on stage.\n\n\nLearn more about Mr. Rose on their website page. \nLearn more about Era ‘Of Love’ on their IG.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/the-space-for-music-mr-rose-dream-house-with-era-of-love/
LOCATION:the Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mr-Rose-10-3-26-scaled-e1789341403735.jpeg
END:VEVENT
