SUMMARY:Acrylic Pouring Workshop with Mohanima
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an in-person\, 1 day workshop where you will learn fluid art techniques for acrylic paints. This is a lively and fun\, hands-on art making experience for all ages.  Learn how to prepare your paints with various pouring mediums that when processed with a hair dryer\, reveal the most unexpected and beautiful abstract art. \nYour teacher\, Rakhi of Mohanima Art\, will guide you through the whole process.  You can watch videos of the process on her Instagram. \nDiscussion on how to put a protective finish on your piece will also be covered. \nAll materials will be provide so just bring your fabulous self.  Each participant will create their own unique work of art. \nTuesday\, October 6\, 1 – 4 pm \nPrice: $150\n(Incl all supplies) \nTo purchase tickets go to their website page here – after signing up you will be taken to the ticket page to complete purchase.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/acrylic-pouring-workshop-with/
LOCATION:the Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-07-12-at-10.53.25-AM-e1783868057673.png
END:VEVENT
